1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,115
Do‘stingiz ZAMIN FK’da kim bo‘lardi?

2
00:00:03,135 --> 00:00:04,037
Jasur.

3
00:00:04,057 --> 00:00:06,001
Hammani qutqaradigan do‘st!

4
00:00:06,021 --> 00:00:06,723
Doston.

5
00:00:06,843 --> 00:00:09,332
Hammadan oldin yetib keladigan do‘st!

6
00:00:09,352 --> 00:00:10,121
Aziz.

7
00:00:10,141 --> 00:00:12,174
Hamma joyda yuguradigan do‘st!

8
00:00:12,194 --> 00:00:13,239
Bekzod.

9
00:00:13,259 --> 00:00:15,172
Doim zarba beradigan do‘st!

10
00:00:15,192 --> 00:00:17,500
Hamma joyda o‘ynaydigan do‘stingiz-chi?

11
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,267
Uning o‘rni ham tayyor!

12
00:00:19,287 --> 00:00:21,376
Do‘stingizni izohda belgilang.

13
00:00:21,396 --> 00:00:25,596
Obuna bo‘ling — keyingi qism eng ko‘p belgilangan o‘yinchi haqida!

